---
---
<section id="how-to-measure" class="py-10 sm:py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto border-t border-hairline">
  <div class="mb-8 sm:mb-12 text-center md:text-left">
    <span class="inline-block py-1 px-3 rounded-full bg-canvas-soft-2 border border-hairline text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-3">
      Step-by-Step Guide
    </span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-ink mb-4">How to Measure Your Bra Size</h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-body max-w-2xl">
      Finding your exact size requires just two simple measurements. Use a soft measuring tape and measure while wearing a non-padded bra.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-8 mb-8 sm:mb-12">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-full bg-primary transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft-2 text-primary font-bold text-base mb-6">
        01
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Step 1: Underbust</h3>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-body mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Wrap the measuring tape snugly right under your bust. Ensure it is parallel to the ground all the way around your ribcage.
      </p>
      <div class="h-44 sm:h-48 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/img/measure-underbust.svg" alt="Step 1: Underbust Measurement" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-full bg-primary transition-opacity opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100"></div>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft-2 text-primary font-bold text-base mb-6">
        02
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">Step 2: Overbust</h3>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-body mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Measure loosely around the fullest part of your bust. The tape should rest lightly without pressing into your skin.
      </p>
      <div class="h-44 sm:h-48 bg-canvas border border-hairline rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center p-2 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/img/measure-bust.svg" alt="Step 2: Overbust Measurement" class="w-full h-full object-contain" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Measurement Best Practices: DO'S & DON'TS -->
  <div class="mb-8 sm:mb-12 bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
    <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-6 text-center md:text-left flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-primary flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
      </svg>
      Measurement Do's & Don'ts
    </h3>
    
    <!-- Hero Comparison Visual -->
    <div class="mb-8 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-hairline shadow-xs">
      <img src="/img/bra-measure-dos-donts.jpg" alt="Bra Size Measurement Visual Guide: Correct vs Incorrect Technique" class="w-full h-auto max-h-80 object-cover" />
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- DO'S -->
      <div class="bg-emerald-500/5 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-lg">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold">✓</div>
            DO'S
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-body">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Wear an unpadded bra:</strong> Measures your natural breast shape best.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Correct posture:</strong> Stand straight and keep your arms relaxed.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Breathe normally:</strong> Don't inhale deeply or hold your breath.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Keep tape flat:</strong> Ensure the measuring tape is level and flat around skin.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- DON'TS -->
      <div class="bg-rose-500/5 border border-rose-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400 font-bold text-lg">
            <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 text-xs font-bold">✕</div>
            DON'TS
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-body">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Don't pull too tight or loose:</strong> Keep tape comfortably snug against your ribcage.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Don't wear ill-fitting bras:</strong> Avoid sports bras or push-up bras during measurement.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
              <span><strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Don't round down fractions:</strong> If you measure 31.5", round up to 32".</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Contextual Link Callout Banner -->
  <div class="p-5 sm:p-6 bg-canvas-soft-2/80 border border-hairline rounded-2xl flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Ready with your numbers?</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-body mt-0.5">Use our tools to calculate your baseline or compare international sizes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/#calculator" class="px-4 py-2 bg-primary text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors shadow-2xs">
        Calculate Your Bra Size &rarr;
      </a>
      <a href="/#chart-section" class="px-4 py-2 bg-surface border border-hairline text-ink text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-canvas-soft-2 transition-colors shadow-2xs">
        International Bra Size Chart
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
